OL,3,GNEWSAFestival to celebrate trees in
OL,4,Anature and art
OL,5,
OL,6,FA festival which celebrates trees is
OL,7,Fbeing held in Hull city centre.
OL,9,FTreefest aims to "inspire communities
OL,10,Fto value, protect and care for" trees,
OL,11,Faccording to organisers Hull and East
OL,12,FRiding Friends of the Earth (HFOE).
OL,14,FHeld at the Pier Street Pop-Up Space on
OL,15,FHumber Street on Saturday, it will
OL,16,Ffeature stalls, games, art and story
OL,17,Fand poetry performances as well as a
OL,18,Fchance to talk to experts from
OL,19,Forganisations like Yorkshire Wildlife
OL,20,FTrust, the Woodland Trust and the RSPB.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
