OL,3,GNEWSAFestival to celebrate trees in
OL,4,Anature and art
OL,5,
OL,6,FLauren Saunders from HFOE said trees
OL,7,Fwere vital for the environment and Hull
OL,8,Fand East Yorkshire had fewer trees
OL,9,Fcompared with the rest of the UK.
